<title>SPAIN: 15 pct of Repsol seen sold to employees.</title>
<headline>15 pct of Repsol seen sold to employees.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The upcoming privatisation of Spanish energy group Repsol will reserve a 15 percent tranche for employees of the company, sources close to the operation told Reuters on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;The privatisation foresees 15 percent for employees,&quot; one source said.</p>
<p>The remaining 85 percent is likely to be split approximately evenly between institutions (both domestic and international) and small shareholders, the sources said.</p>
<p>However the 85 percent tranche would be flexible, and one or other tranche could be increased, depending on demand.</p>
</text>
